 stances. Adapt to the chaos of the mist by seamlessly swapping fighting styles mid-battle to dominate any encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into deep customization with expansive talent trees, tailoring your loadout using dozens of rare gem affixes and a vast array of active skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break free from rigid class restraints—whether you favor relentless assault, elusive maneuvering, heavy crowd control, or unyielding defense, you define the rules of your hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282300/extras/1f535e2e7f033bd59b2dc3fb8bc15979.poster.avif?t=1788260553\" width=1170 height=810 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282300/extras/1f535e2e7f033bd59b2dc3fb8bc15979.webm?t=1788260553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282300/extras/1f535e2e7f033bd59b2dc3fb8bc15979.mp4?t=1788260553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stalk the mist as a lone wolf, or band together in a three-player squad. In this hazardous realm, fighting back-to-back with your companions is the surest way to crush towering monstrosities, outmaneuver rival hunting parties, and guarantee a safe extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282300/extras/152b157c922954289603c76bff23bb12.poster.avif?t=1788260553\" width=1170 height=810 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282300/extras/152b157c922954289603c76bff23bb12.webm?t=1788260553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sha